### Changes in this version (8.0.0-pre.11) since 8.0.0-pre.10

#### New features:
 - [2026-08-18:]: unavailable nodes are now hidden by default
 - [2026-08-18:]: stopped creating double licenses for cloud only sign-ups
 - [2026-08-18:]: added hubspot email functionality to stripe endpoint
 - [2026-08-18:]: added customer deleted endpoint
 - [2026-08-18:]: also listen for subscription cancel events
 - [2026-08-18:]: enabled update_subscription endpoint
 - [2026-08-18:]: added update_subscription endpoint
 - [2026-08-11:]: added missing background-tasks
 - [2026-08-11:]: added further endpoints for stripe
 - [2026-08-11:]: added initial version of stripe endpoint
 - [2026-08-11:]: added initial versions of stripe endpoints
 - [2026-08-11:]: added better error reporting when lacking policy permissions
 - [2026-08-11:]: added support for multiple license policies and restricting access based on policy
 - [2026-08-06:]: updated programs to use bundled binaries as defaults

#### Bugfixes:
 - [2026-08-30:]: fixed job queue program not filtering correctly
 - [2026-08-18:]: fixed push instead of append
 - [2026-08-18:]: fixed using wrong ID in update endpoint
 - [2026-08-12:]: fix for when a user adds an additional license
 - [2026-08-12:]: fixed typo
 - [2026-08-12:]: slurm allocation should be updated even if the user account already exists
 - [2026-08-12:]: checkout webhook now checks for 6 licenses instead of just 2
 - [2026-08-11:]: added missing comma
 - [2026-08-11:]: fixed missing variables
 - [2026-08-11:]: fixed endpoint
 - [2026-08-11:]: fixed call to non-existant pre()
 - [2026-08-11:]: fixed destination.pre() not being called from resumable configs
 - [2026-08-07:]: fixed missing program stats
 - [2026-08-06:]: fixed showing hidden queue usage in API (fixed digichem-desktop#103)
 - [2026-08-04:]: fixed bundling both digichem and digilib into same dir

#### Miscellaneous:
 - [2026-08-30:]: bumped version to pre.11
